---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Alumni Network — Information Systems Program"
  description="Alumni Association of Information Systems at Universitas Darwan Ali (IKA-SISFO UNDA). Career testimonials, graduate achievements, and industry partnerships."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white border-b border-navy-800 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-navy-950 border border-gold-500/40 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-300 mb-4">
          <span>Professional Graduate Network</span>
          <span class="text-slate-600">·</span>
          <span>IKA-SISFO UNDA</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold font-editorial tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
          Alumni & Career Impact
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Information Systems alumni from Universitas Darwan Ali make impactful contributions as System Analysts, Data Scientists, ICT Project Managers, Software Engineers, government IT officers, and tech entrepreneurs across regional and national sectors.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-16">
    
    {/* Testimonials */}
    <section>
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4 mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-600 block">Alumni Voices</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 font-editorial">
          Graduate Career Testimonials
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="card-academic p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "The practical labs in ERP and database management at SISFO UNDA provided directly applicable skills for industrial supply chains in large agricultural enterprises."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-gold-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center font-editorial">
              R
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900">Rian Pratama, S.Kom.</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">ERP Specialist — PT Sinarmas Agro</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-academic p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "Research mentoring in Machine Learning and Computer Vision opened direct career paths into Data Science roles in Jakarta's tech ecosystem."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-gold-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center font-editorial">
              S
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900">Siti Nurhaliza, S.Kom.</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Junior Data Scientist — Tech Startup</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-academic p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
              "Proficiency in business process reengineering (BPMN) and IT Governance empowered me to lead municipal digital public service transformations."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-900 text-gold-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center font-editorial">
              A
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy-900">Ahmad Fadillah, S.Kom.</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Senior Computer Officer — Municipal IT Agency</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Tracer Study CTA */}
    <section class="card-academic p-8 sm:p-12 bg-navy-950 text-white border-navy-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 max-w-2xl text-center md:text-left">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400">Curriculum Quality Assurance</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-editorial text-white">
          Help Us Continuous Improve via Alumni Tracer Study
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Your feedback on employment transition, graduate competencies, and workplace feedback is essential for continuous curriculum refinement.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/en/tracer-study/"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap transition-colors"
      >
        Fill Tracer Study Survey →
      </a>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
